<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial">Hi {!Receiving_User.FirstName},</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Welcome to our Scoping Community!</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">To get started, go to {!Community_Url}, logging in with Username: {!Receiving_User.Username} and the password you choose. Please be sure to write down your username and password for logging back in again.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">If you forget your username and password at a later date, please email internalsf@atginfo.com requesting a link to establish a new password.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Once you are in the community, navigate to the Assessment relevant to your needs and fill out the necessary sections. If you'd like to pause and return to the assessment at a later time, just don't forget to hit save.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Once you have completed the assessment to the best of your abilities, with the assessment, check the</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">"Finish Assessment" box on the final section of the questionnaire.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Thank you!</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">ATG Cognizant</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>